Here's something I discovered the other day that I don't remember ever
seeing posted here. Very minor spoiler follows:



If you're chained to a heavy iron ball, you can use it to move around
very quickly. Just throw it in the direction you want to go, and you'll
get dragged along with it. It sounds painful, but it isn't. You should
move a few squares, depending on your strength. (It takes around 15-16
for this trick to start being effective).

It might not be the most useful trick, but it might let you escape a
fight in a hurry!


